# Reboot without data loss
name: reboot-no-data-loss
version: 1
description: Observations persist across reboot.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
read CHIP-001
read CHIP-002
reboot
assert observations 2
assert next_sequence 3
assert boot_counter 2
assert node_id unchanged
assert observation 0 sequence 1
assert observation 1 sequence 2
assert observation 0 chip_id CHIP-001
assert observation 1 chip_id CHIP-002